Beobras comes out of the bushes – Conan's father! He is girded by an ammunition belt and holds a shotgun in his hands. Your parents and a large group of men appear from behind the trees.

"Well, Henry, I will give you a proper spanking when we get back!" father shakes his fist at you.

Suddenly, you feel great tiredness, mixed with relief and disappointment. Yes, you survived the night in the jungle, coped with other dangers, but the price for your release was too high... Adventures are not always the same as books describe them. You close your eyes and give way to your tears.